    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Smash Simulator VR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Virtual Reality Destruction Experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash chaos. Break boundaries. Relieve stress.</strong><br>Step into <i>Smash Simulator VR</i>, a fully immersive rage room experience where your only goal is simple: <strong>destroy everything in sight</strong>. Whether you're venting after a tough day or just craving some satisfying physics-based mayhem, this game offers the perfect sandbox of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash glassware in a bar, flip desks in a modern office, or tear down furniture in a high-rise apartment \u2014 every environment is fully interactable and built for total annihilation. With realistic object physics, responsive VR controls, and a growing arsenal of tools, <strong>Smash Simulator VR</strong> is not just a game. It's a release.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Destructible Environments:</strong> Bars, offices, living rooms and more \u2013 each space filled with objects waiting to be smashed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Physics:</strong> Every shattered glass, bent chair, and broken screen behaves as you'd expect in the real world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive VR Gameplay:</strong> Grab, throw, hit, and destroy using intuitive motion controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stress-Relief Focused:</strong> Built from the ground up to offer players a satisfying outlet for tension and frustration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tool Variety:</strong> Smash with baseball bats, sledgehammers, stools, and more \u2013 or just use your fists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score &amp; Combo System (Optional):</strong> Compete with yourself or others for the most effective rampage.</p></li></ul>",
